<title>SOUTH AFRICA: HCI says in further talks.</title>
<headline>HCI says in further talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hosken Consolidated Investments Ltd (HCI) said on Wednesday it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement but said the negotiations were not related to talks with Crendell Investment Corp Ltd -- first announced on September 5 -- regarding HCI's stake in Crendell.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
